   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "BACKGROUND ACTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 4, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Setting\n   2 Interior or exterior\n   3 Motion of the environment\n   4 Temperature\n   5 Weather\n   6 Scale of the place\n   7 Repetition in frame\n   8 Crowds and repeats\n   9 The people behind react, or carry on\n  10 A little story behind them\n  11 Danger behind their back\n  12 Signs and screens behind them\n  13 The season\n  14 suite: The weather feels it too\n  15 suite: Sea of people\n  16 suite: Symmetrical storybook\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 4, CC 17 to 32\n   1 suite: Busy city street\n   2 suite: Nobody looks up\n   3 suite: Behind you!\n   4 suite: A busy world behind them\n   5 pair: When it rains, surfaces are soaked\n   6 pair: When sadness rises, the rain starts\n   7 pair: When tension rises, the background goes still\n   8 pair: When the leader moves, the crowd follows in a ripple\n   9 pair: When the scene jumps to a new place, its sound arrives first\n  10 pair: When the scene moves outside, we hear more of the world off screen\n  11 pair: When it is hot, people talk slower\n  12 pair: When a pattern fills the frame, the subject goes dead center\n  13 pair: When the people behind stop and stare, shame rises\n  14 pair: When the people behind carry on as normal, loneliness grows\n  15 pair: When the people behind cheer, pride rises\n  16 pair: When the little story behind crashes into the main one, things get worse\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 4, CC 33 to 44\n   1 pair: When the little story behind gets easier to spot, the laughs come more often\n   2 pair: When the danger behind them shows more clearly, dread rises\n   3 pair: When we see danger they cannot, we know before they do\n   4 pair: When the danger behind them rushes in, the tension spikes\n   5 pair: When a sign behind them jokes about the scene, a visual gag lands\n   6 pair: When a screen behind them tells us news, a clue is planted\n   7 pair: When more seasons pass, the story skips further in time\n   8 pair: When the season stands for things fading, nostalgia comes\n   9 pairs: The world mirrors the feeling\n  10 pairs: Sound of the place\n  11 pairs: Deadpan storybook\n  12 pairs: Look behind you"
   },
